{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18573","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苞枿𪒶矣，惟根之蟠\n弥巴蔽荆，负南极以安。\n[冃]我旧梁氏，缉绥艰难。\n江汉之阻，都邑固以完。\n圣人作，神武用。\n有臣勇智，奋不以衆。\n投迹死地，谋猷纵。\n化敌爲家，虑则中。\n浩浩海裔，不威而同。\n系缧降王，定厥功。\n澶漫万里，宣唐风。\n蛮夷九译，咸来从。\n凯旋金奏，象形容。\n震赫万国，罔不龚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}